  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Format for 0 before decimal by @mrbenevolentcanard in https://github.com/CppCXY/EmmyLuaCodeStyle/pull/203\n* remove prefix of lublib by @Freed-Wu in https://github.com/CppCXY/EmmyLuaCodeStyle/pull/205\n* add pre-commit hooks by @Freed-Wu in https://github.com/CppCXY/EmmyLuaCodeStyle/pull/206\n* Revise formatting behavior documentation by @waddie96 in https://github.com/CppCXY/EmmyLuaCodeStyle/pull/210\n\n## New Contributors\n* @mrbenevolentcanard made their first contribution in https://github.com/CppCXY/EmmyLuaCodeStyle/pull/203\n* @Freed-Wu made their first contribution in https://github.com/CppCXY/EmmyLuaCodeStyle/pull/205\n* @waddie96 made their first contribution in https://github.com/CppCXY/EmmyLuaCodeStyle/pull/210\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/CppCXY/EmmyLuaCodeStyle/compare/1.5.7...1.6.0",
